<view class="container"><button wx:if="{{needsLogin}}" bindtap="login">登录查看在线卡</button><view class="card">在线卡共用你的钱包余额。首次刷卡启动，同一卡再次刷卡追加冻结套餐的时长；扣款和退款可在资金流水查看。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}">读取中…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card">{{error}}<button bindtap="load">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{!loading &amp;&amp; !needsLogin &amp;&amp; !cards.length}}" class="card">尚无绑定卡，请联系管理员核验绑定。</view><view wx:for="{{cards}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view>{{item.card_no}} · {{item.label}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'active'}}" data-card="{{item.card_no}}" data-status="lost" bindtap="change" disabled="{{busy}}">挂失</button><button data-card="{{item.card_no}}" data-status="unbound" bindtap="change" disabled="{{busy}}">解绑</button></view></view>
